ct&Win Items Potion bottles Added\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added metadata for new 3D sports models: Baseball, Bowling Pin, and Ping Pong Paddle.\n  * Added metadata for a new 3D weapon model: Skull Potion.\n  * Added metadata for new prefab items: Collect&Win Potion (Medium Blue2, Green2, Orange2, Pink2, Red1), Baseball Small Red3, Bowling Pin Medium Red3, and PingPong Paddle Medium Red1.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bcfc0fbc0ad3fce7c38fc8e140846f692eb1e2d3", "head_ref": "ClaireNewObjects_03", "head_sha": "235e49e243d90b7cf79b1140449a2de1eef78394", "additions": 1968, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 24, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-08T13:22:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2458", "field": "number", "value": 468, "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#468", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 468, "title": "Collect And Win", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added \"Collect & Win\" live event: collect tokens in levels, track progress, claim stage rewards and a grand prize; main screen, progress widget, info panel, stage/prize items, and level-end token display.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Tokens spawn in unlocked levels, persist on level win, can be saved/claimed; new VFX/animations and reward-screen queuing.\n\n* **Developer Tools**\n  * Debug panel options to add tokens and reset event data; new backend requests to support the flow.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added sprites, prefabs, materials and asset metadata for the event.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f5c0bb3a977a2d9b4e6b9559cd382d65548cb6c0", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/winAndCollect", "head_sha": "648e2c7b9c1d9e263f4b43a45e135ba9fa6002fd", "additions": 54216, "deletions": 32, "changed_files": 127, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-26T20:16:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-29T16:13:50Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-29T16:13:50Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-29T16:13:50Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2461", "field": "number", "value": 470, "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#470", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 470, "title": "Collect And Win minor bugs fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fixes:\r\n* When the page opened, it shows placeholder images at first.\r\n* After level completion, it first shows placeholder icon and progress for the event, then shows the correct one\r\n* In every level, I got two errors both backend and client. \r\n* In Boss arena and endless mode, the c&w UI is visible. \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Refactor\n  - Collect & Win screens now use pooled UI items for faster loading, smoother scrolling, reduced flicker, improved ordering and cleanup when refreshing content.\n- New Features\n  - Auto-scrolls to the first unclaimed reward/grand prize when opening the screen.\n  - Reward and grand-prize items now reflect claimed state (labels hidden for claimed stages).\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Next Reward icon visibility corrected based on event lock.\n  - Token counter/panel shown only when relevant (avoids Endless/Infinite Boss modes).\n  - UI elements remain hidden until data/initialization to prevent brief flashes.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "88879d8bb88eef8203be592f5189a76d17f3b782", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/winAndCollectMinorBugs", "head_sha": "4935e9483a95d78b3a58d18794bacd97816787e8", "additions": 166, "deletions": 33, "changed_files": 10, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-29T21:22:50Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-30T15:51:15Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-30T15:51:15Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-30T15:51:15Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2462", "field": "number", "value": 471, "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#471", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 471, "title": "Samuel/zom 498 536", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fixing UI Elements - UI polishes.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Leaderboard toggle now updates its text shadow color based on state for clearer visual feedback.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Increased texture resolution and adjusted compression for multiple booster icons to improve clarity.\n  * Added new sprite assets (e.g., tornado popup, blue bar) and updated Daily Gift sprite configuration.\n  * Updated platform-specific texture settings (including Windows Store) for more consistent visuals across devices.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "88879d8bb